# PokerNow exports are captured bytes, not source.
#
# Git for Windows defaults to core.autocrlf=true, which rewrites every LF to
# CRLF on checkout. For these logs that is corruption: the multi-line
# "Game Config Changes" entry carries its newlines *inside* a quoted CSV field,
# so the rewrite changes the field's contents and the grammar stops matching it.
# The parser is correct; the checked-out file was not. Keep these byte-identical
# to what PokerNow serves.
*.csv -text
